('02-partial-sequence','Partial settlement confirmation sequence','image39.png','§6.3 Partial Settlement Confirmation, paragraph343','sequence',seqhead+'  I->>E: SecuritiesSettlementTransactionInstruction\n  opt Optional\n    E->>I: SecuritiesSettlementTransactionStatusAdvice\n    E->>I: SecuritiesSettlementTransactionStatusAdvice\n  end\n  E->>I: SecuritiesSettlementTransactionConfirmation\n  Note right of E: Partial\n  opt Optional\n    E->>I: SecuritiesSettlementTransactionStatusAdvice\n  end\n  E->>I: SecuritiesSettlementTransactionConfirmation\n  Note right of E: Remaining quantity\n','One optional box encloses two statuses before partial confirmation. Second optional box encloses one status after partial confirmation. Final confirmation is annotated Remaining quantity.','partial-settlement'),
